				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				29,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update Cocoon and Wind submodules with advanced extension and synchronization capabilities\n\nThis commit updates both Cocoon and Wind submodules to their latest versions, bringing significant enhancements to the CodeEditorLand ecosystem's extension hosting and synchronization infrastructure.\n\n**Cocoon Updates:**\n- Implemented core ExtensionHostService with Mountain integration via gRPC for robust IPC communication\n- Added comprehensive extension lifecycle management including activation, deactivation, and status monitoring\n- Established VSCode-compatible extension hosting patterns with performance tracking and error handling\n- Introduced detailed documentation (VSCODE-EXTENSION-HOST-ANALYSIS.md) analyzing VSCode extension host patterns and integration strategies\n\n**Wind Updates:**\n- Implemented AdvancedSyncService for real-time document synchronization and UI state management with Mountain backend\n- Added support for complex synchronization scenarios including conflict resolution and performance monitoring\n- Established Tauri-based connection to Mountain with configurable synchronization intervals\n- Built foundation for collaborative editing and multi-window UI consistency\n\nThese updates strengthen the core infrastructure for VSCode-compatible extension hosting and real-time synchronization capabilities, enhancing the overall integration between Wind frontend and Mountain backend systems.",
			"SHA": "69079c7f0a05ae6471a74db5c015cd120b640186"
		},
