			],
			"Message": "chore(submodules): Update all submodules and add advanced implementation tracking\n\nThis commit updates all submodules (Cocoon, Mountain, Sky, Wind) to their latest versions and introduces the ADVANCED-IMPLEMENTATION-TRACKING.md document to comprehensively monitor the advanced enhancements in the CodeEditorLand ecosystem.\n\nKey updates include:\n- **Cocoon**: Added complementary development analysis and progress tracking documentation, enhancing alignment with Wind and Mountain systems.\n- **Mountain**: General improvements and updates.\n- **Sky**: Implemented advanced performance monitoring and build optimization with Microsoft-inspired patterns, improving build times and bundle sizes.\n- **Wind**: Fixed authentication handling for special characters in usernames, ensuring reliable login functionality.\n\nThe new tracking document provides a detailed overview of the implementation status, risk assessment, and success metrics, solidifying the foundation for future development.",
			"SHA": "eed7f77776a6406d7d480f12413b419f2bd553e5"
		}
